MISSION=GOVERNANCE_LOOP_V1

OBJECTIVE
Supervise the Runtime autonomously.

RESPONSIBILITIES
- Observe Runtime health
- Observe Mission Ledger
- Select the next eligible mission
- Start Mission Loop
- Detect blockers
- Stop on policy violation
- Request human approval only for promotion

INPUTS
- Mission Ledger
- Runtime Health
- Migration Status
- Policies

OUTPUTS
- Next Mission
- Decision
- Runtime State

SUCCESS
- Runtime drives itself
- Human validates promotions only
